Text: 2.2.2 Bootstrapping Procedure Since the IAC data set contains a large num- ber of unannotated debate forum posts, we embedd AutoSlog-TS in a bootstrapping framework to learn additional patterns. The ﬂow diagram for the boot- strapping system is shown in Figure 4. Figure 4: Flow Diagram for Bootstrapping Process Initially, we give the labeled training data to AutoSlog-TS, which generates patterns and asso- ciated statistics.

