Text: An additional source of dialogic structure in these dis- cussions, above and beyond the thread structure, is the use of the quote mechanism, which is an in- terface feature that allows participants to optionally break down a previous post into the components of its argument and respond to each component in turn. The IAC includes 10,003 Quote-Response (Q-R) pairs with annotations for FACTUAL vs. FEELING argument style, across a range of topics.

